{"parse": {"title": "风暴前夜-01", "pageid": 128092, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E6%88%88%E5%B0%94%C2%B7%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%A4%9C\" title=\"伊戈尔·风暴前夜\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">风暴前夜-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%A4%9C-02\" title=\"风暴前夜-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">风暴前夜</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.94.A8.E9.A9.AC.E8.B9.84.E6.9D.A5.E7.BF.BB.E8.80.95\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"用马蹄来翻耕\">用马蹄来翻耕</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 用马蹄来翻耕</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Furrowed by Hooves</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_03_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_03_zone\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_03_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e0/Cg-3_3_at_03_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"348\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"428\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>不要回头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>同志们，向前跑，不要回头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">士兵，你的任务就是站在这里，如果我们中有人转身逃跑……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">你就用这把枪，直接打死他，就像打野兔子一样。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_03_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_03_zone\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_03_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e0/Cg-3_3_at_03_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"348\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"428\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>是的，长官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">我相信我们的队伍，没有一个战士会退缩。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_03_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_03_zone\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_03_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e0/Cg-3_3_at_03_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"348\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"428\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>没有一个战士会退缩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的手一直很稳，不管是对着野兔、大雁、敌军，还是自己的战友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但雪太大了，雪花落在了枪管上，压得他的手微微颤抖起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">伊戈尔，别担心，我们没有人会往回跑。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有人跑回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵把食指稍微从扳机上移开，以防金属黏住手指——那里冻得像一块冰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔再次按住那块冰——瞄准镜里出现了一个人影。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_ye\"><img alt=\"hubian_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-hubian_ye.png/600px-Cg-hubian_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-hubian_ye.png/900px-Cg-hubian_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-hubian_ye.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔早就看见了那个士兵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵和战马都沉默地藏在树林的阴影里，但月光还是照亮了军帽上的徽章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔拍了拍自己的战马，红马优雅地踏了几步，低下头喝水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>放心，这条小河的水足够两匹马喝，士兵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵：</div><div>是，将军！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵迈着正步将马牵到小河旁，在伊戈尔面前站定，敬了个军礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵：</div><div>报道！骑兵团一营……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>格里高利·安德烈耶维奇，你是骑兵团的侦察兵，我知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵的脸涨红了，这让他并不端正的高鼻子看起来更歪了一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>我不知道您记得我的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我记得你们每个人的名字。我还知道，你父亲是顿河的哥萨克。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-528102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-528102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-528102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">战马：</div><div>咴——咴——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一匹漂亮的白马，刷得干干净净，马鞍上没有一点磨损，四角银饰闪闪发亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>三色编织的鞍袋装得鼓鼓囊囊。像要去过节，或者远行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们确实要远行——别列格勒之战后，伊戈尔军休整了几日，就要拔营。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但拔营的前夜，牵着战马出行的士兵……这不符合任何一条军规。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>将军，我知道士兵不该擅自离营，但是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我只是来这条小河饮马，中士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他打断了士兵接下来的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>看看这条河，看看这片草原。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金色的草原即将入冬，空气里是腐烂的橡树皮辛辣的气味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>羽茅草挺直身子，闪着幽微的银光，这银光又倏忽向下伏去，勾勒出风的形状。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你们可能已经不记得它的样子了，但你父亲一定记得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>这里也是我的故乡，在离开之前，我想回来看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>河水像一块深绿的翡翠，它不慌不忙地流着，知道自己迟早会到达大海。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>像你们这个年纪的哥萨克，恐怕都没有在顿河里抓过鱼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>我记得的，将军。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵突然说。他的喉咙变得不那么紧了，声音里自然地带上一丝稚气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>我记得小时候父亲带我来顿河钓鱼，在月亮很圆的晚上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>我太小了，还不能划船，父亲也不划，就等河水把我们的船带到顿河中央。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>然后父亲往水里撒一把黑麦粒，放下鱼线。月亮升到头顶上的时候，钓竿头突然往下弯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>那时候河里的鱼力气大得像公牛，父亲在水里把它遛乏了，才抓上来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>是一条金色的鲤鱼，还张着嘴喘气哩！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>父亲把鲤鱼扔到篓子里让我背回去，说他明天要上战场了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>河水泛起一圈涟漪，鱼儿听到说话声，不敢露出自己闪光的鳞片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>今天在顿河抓鱼，明天就上战场，这就是哥萨克，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔的目光没有在河上停留太久，他大步向白色的战马走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白马发出一声活泼的嘶鸣，好奇地朝红色战马走了几步，又折返回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你父亲不仅教会了你钓鱼，还教会了你养马。这是一匹漂亮的儿马。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>嗯，我自己刷马，给它喂燕麦和豆饼，这孩子不喜欢黑麦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>是一匹好战马。是要去冲锋的，不是去拉大炮的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔拉住马的辔头，白马晃了晃脑袋，拿头去蹭将军的手臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>嘿……好孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔看着白马黑亮又湿润的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>但它还没上过战场，害怕炮声吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>将军，您怎么看出它没上过战场？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>和人一样。上过战场的人，和没上过战场的人，眼神是不一样的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>它让我想起以前的佩伦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>佩伦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔吹了声口哨，高大的红马甩了甩头，来到他身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我战友起的名字，因为它跑起来势如雷霆。但这孩子以前连炮声都害怕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>你现在看起来真威风，伙计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格里高利用艳羡的目光看着高大的战马。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>我在马厩里见过它很多次，您一直带着它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵轻轻拍了拍佩伦的脖子，战马没有躲开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>它几岁了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>快二十岁，要退役的年纪了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>但它很漂亮。它什么时候开始上的战场？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>已经是十五年前的事了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十五年前，在伊戈尔成为现在的伊戈尔将军之前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在“暴雨”之前。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马儿喝饱了水，北斗七星矮矮地卧在地平线上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔跨上战马。他打量着整装待发的白马，和握着缰绳的士兵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>中士，咱们是同路吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格里高利将军帽压下来一点，帽檐的阴影遮住了他的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>或许是的，将军。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "风暴前夜-01"}}